    <expertiseList>
      <Value>
{"layout":{"Umbraco.BlockList":[{"contentUdi":"umb://element/4513af601e594534b783755e352fe13b"},{"contentUdi":"umb://element/c337d54874fd4a5aa38db586c6069326"},{"contentUdi":"umb://element/f84665a61c584b22857e40c590be2682"}]},"contentData":[{"contentTypeKey":"338ac17e-85de-40c4-8028-34adf753b3c6","udi":"umb://element/4513af601e594534b783755e352fe13b","PropType":null,"stringItemText":"Geotechnical Investigations"},{"contentTypeKey":"338ac17e-85de-40c4-8028-34adf753b3c6","udi":"umb://element/c337d54874fd4a5aa38db586c6069326","PropType":null,"stringItemText":"Concrete Testing and Investigations"},{"contentTypeKey":"338ac17e-85de-40c4-8028-34adf753b3c6","udi":"umb://element/f84665a61c584b22857e40c590be2682","PropType":null,"stringItemText":"Soil Testing and Investigations"}],"settingsData":[]}
</Value>
    </expertiseList>
    <grid>
      <Value>
{"layout":{"Umbraco.BlockGrid":[{"contentUdi":"umb://element/c49e1d3c975a47ef87b3c2a0f3ebd98f","areas":[],"columnSpan":12,"rowSpan":1}]},"contentData":[{"contentTypeKey":"9a4f7c2e-1b3d-4e8a-bf01-7d62a8f5c930","udi":"umb://element/c49e1d3c975a47ef87b3c2a0f3ebd98f","content":"\u003cp\u003e“These projects are, as I mentioned, very close to my heart. I get to experience and be a part of the development that’s happening in my home town and in areas I grew up around. It’s very special.”\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/d2jl4a0v/polokwane-2.jpg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"heading-h3\"\u003eA new signalised intersection in Seshego\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e“Seshego is my home town, so it’s especially rewarding to be working here.”\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWe are providing soil testing and nuclear densities for this project on  Nelson Mandela Drive, Seshego.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis will enable the upgrading an existing 5-legged round-about into a new signalised 4-\u003cbr\u003elegged intersection that improves driver safety.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/taoh5cgn/1.png\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"heading-h3\"\u003eNew Private Hospital in Burgersfort\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e“My aunt and uncle stayed in Burgersfort. We visited them often.”\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBurgersfort Private hospital (Mediclinic) Building from scratch. We are doing concrete testing. Rebound hammer, some cubes. Columns, beams - early stage. \u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/2m0nsdfq/2.png\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"heading-h3\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"?rmode=max\u0026amp;width=984\u0026amp;height=553\" alt=\"A photo of Potego on site\" width=\"984\" height=\"553\" data-udi=\"umb://media/0871f3dd9b6149dc96302ebb52e3359c\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"heading-h3\"\u003eWhat is it like to build the area you\u0027ve always called home?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePotego clarifies what this new development means, both for the area and for himself.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e“Working on projects close to home has been a blessing and exciting.”\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNothing beats the feeling of being involved in projects that are close to your heart. Seeing the development of your own kasi (hometown) is great, but being a part of the team that builds it is special!!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e“Nothing compares to the feeling of seeing people excited because of a completed development where they’ll be shopping, or using the roads or seeing stormwater drains in action… and being there to say “I BUILT THAT!”\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"heading-h3\"\u003eMapungubwe National Park - New Roads In Park\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e“My family is adventerous. we like to tour the parks. And now I’m helping build it.”\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStabilisation mix designs and centreline  investigations, part of early assessments \u003cbr\u003efor new roads. \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe park employs many people in the area.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/gehnihtg/3.png\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"heading-h3\"\u003eNkuna Kraal Filling Station\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e“Giyani completes my trip around all of Polokwane. We really are seeing the entire province.”\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWe are geotechnical testing, compaction tests and DCP’s to enable building platforms, services, storm water pipes and more.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis new Sasol filling station represents new building and development next to a mall that we \u003cbr\u003ealso assisted with building.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/vnnpsdjo/4.png\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"heading-h3\"\u003eInterested in our work?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"heading-h3\"\u003eReach out to us.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n"}],"settingsData":[]}
</Value>
    </grid>
    <heroContent>
      <Value><![CDATA[{
  "markup": "<p>Roadlab is an accomplished supporter of over 400 construction companies and 60 consulting firms. Our particle size analysis capabilities enable us to support their aggregate, soils and quality control needs.</p>",
  "blocks": {
    "contentData": [],
    "settingsData": []
  }
}]]></Value>
